<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-hydei-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila hydei 2.3 µm Turing wavenumber (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Each modelling step in the docstring points at a function: jacobian, dispersion, critical wavenumber, gamma sweep, ablation, specimen segmentation, and the GIF composite. The math-kg YAML repeats those laws with Lean loci. Turing 1952 is cited as the instability theorem, not as a line-by-line transcription of his ring-of-cells examples." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-hydei-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-hydei-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-hydei-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila hydei 2.3 µm Turing wavenumber (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Schnakenberg steady state, Jacobian, continuous dispersion, and the discrete five-point dispersion used by the solver are implemented and self-tested (trace=-0.2, det=1). Oscillatory modes now contribute Re(σ) via the Hilbert envelope instead of being dropped. Lean proves the scaled inequalities and the chronoseries bounds with zero sorry. The kinetics remain a reconstruction at the slot scale, not a hydei-specific published parameter set." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-hydei-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-hydei-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-hydei-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-hydei-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
